{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "At the farther end of the largest hall, a table was set with golden cups and golden plates in long rows.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["At", " the", " farther", " end", " of", " the", " largest", " hall", ",", " a", " table", " was", " set", " with", " golden", " cups", " and", " golden", " plates", " in", " long", " rows", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "He is a welcome figure at the garden parties of the elect, who are always ready to encourage him by accepting free seats for his play. Actor managers nod to him. Editors allow him to contribute without charge to a symposium on the price of golf balls.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["He", " is", " a", " welcome", " figure", " at", " the", " garden", " parties", " of", " the", " elect", ",", " who", " are", " always", " ready", " to", " encourage", " him", " by", " accepting", " free", " seats", " for", " his", " play", ".", " Actor", " managers", " nod", " to", " him", ".", " Editors", " allow", " him", " to", " contribute", " without", " charge", " to", " a", " sym", "posium", " on", " the", " price", " of", " golf", " balls", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "And I should begin with a short homily on, celibacy.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["And", " I", " should", " begin", " with", " a", " short", " hom", "ily", " on", ",", " celib", "acy", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Lord John taking out gold cigarette case from his left hand upper waistcoat pocket.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Lord", " John", " taking", " out", " gold", " cigarette", " case", " from", " his", " left", " hand", " upper", " waist", "coat", " pocket", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "The bogus legislature numbered thirty-six members.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["The", " bogus", " legislature", " numbered", " thirty", "-six", " members", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Private persons who at least the Free State Hotel vainly besought the various authorities to present the destruction of their property.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Private", " persons", " who", " at", " least", " the", " Free", " State", " Hotel", " vain", "ly", " bes", "ought", " the", " various", " authorities", " to", " present", " the", " destruction", " of", " their", " property", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Among other persons of distinction who united themselves to him was Lord Napier of Murchison, son of the famous inventor of the logarithms, the person to whom the title of a great man is more justly due, than to any other whom his country ever produced.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Among", " other", " persons", " of", " distinction", " who", " united", " themselves", " to", " him", " was", " Lord", " Nap", "ier", " of", " M", "urch", "ison", ",", " son", " of", " the", " famous", " inventor", " of", " the", " logarith", "ms", ",", " the", " person", " to", " whom", " the", " title", " of", " a", " great", " man", " is", " more", " just", "ly", " due", ",", " than", " to", " any", " other", " whom", " his", " country", " ever", " produced", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "He passed through Henley, St Albans, and came so near to London as Harrow on the Hill.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["He", " passed", " through", " Hen", "ley", ",", " St", " Alb", "ans", ",", " and", " came", " so", " near", " to", " London", " as", " Har", "row", " on", " the", " Hill", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "Some images, like some sensations, feel very familiar, while others feel strange.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["Some", " images", ",", " like", " some", " sensations", ",", " feel", " very", " familiar", ",", " while", " others", " feel", " strange", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
{"lang": "", "lang_probs": [], "emotion": "", "event": "", "text": "The ladies, in compliance with that softness of heart which is their characteristic, are on one side, and the men, by whom the world has to be managed, are on the other.", "timestamps": [], "durations": [], "tokens":["The", " ladies", ",", " in", " compliance", " with", " that", " soft", "ness", " of", " heart", " which", " is", " their", " characteristic", ",", " are", " on", " one", " side", ",", " and", " the", " men", ",", " by", " whom", " the", " world", " has", " to", " be", " managed", ",", " are", " on", " the", " other", "."], "ys_log_probs": [], "words": []}
